# Vanity URLs for printed material and campaigns.
#
# Read from the publish directory by both Cloudflare and Netlify.
#
# Each lands on the index page carrying a src tag, so the hero skin and the
# attribution both come from the ONE normal first-touch path — there is no
# second mechanism that could disagree with the sheet. The prefix is what
# selects the segment, per SRC_SEGMENTS in script.js:
#
#   deed- -> movein      dh- -> pro       (no tag) -> direct
#
# 302, not 301: these are marketing URLs and a permanently cached redirect is
# painful to undo once browsers have it.

/movein   /?src=deed-movein   302
/clean    /?src=dh-clean      302
